ian private limited company (Aksjeselskap) registered in the Enhetsregisteret, and its registered industry is wholesale of beverages (Engroshandel med drikkevarer). The registered activity is import and wholesale of wine and spirits, plus agency business. The latest annual accounts submitted are for 2025, showing sales revenue of 2895519.00 NOK and an annual result of 778277.00 NOK, with total assets of 5263248.00 NOK, against sales revenue of 1493325.00 NOK and an annual result of -333992.00 NOK in 2024. Arne Sneen is listed as both daglig leder (managing director) and styrets leder (chair of the board), with the business address at Strandveien 81A, 1545 HVITSTEN. The company's accounts for 2023, 2024 and 2025 were not audited, and it is not part of a group and is not bankrupt, being wound up, or under compulsory dissolution. The most recent registry change, on 2026-06-17, updated the latest filed accounts year to 2025, and an earlier change on 2026-04-22 updated the business address to Vestby municipality, postcode 1545.","sentences":[{"text":"DIVINUS AS is a Norwegian private limited company (Aksjeselskap) registered in the Enhetsregisteret, and its registered industry is wholesale of beverages (Engroshandel med drikkevarer).","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c4","c8"]},{"text":"The registered activity is import and wholesale of wine and spirits, plus agency business.","claim_ids":["c11"]},{"text":"The latest annual accounts submitted are for 2025, showing sales revenue of 2895519.00 NOK and an annual result of 778277.00 NOK, with total assets of 5263248.00 NOK, against sales revenue of 1493325.00 NOK and an annual result of -333992.00 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c23","c50","c53","c54","c40","c43"]},{"text":"Arne Sneen is listed as both daglig leder (managing director) and styrets leder (chair of the board), with the business address at Strandveien 81A, 1545 HVITSTEN.","claim_ids":["c25","c26","c5"]},{"text":"The company's accounts for 2023, 2024 and 2025 were not audited